  "title": "Abubakar Yerima Idris",
  "content": "Abubakar Yerima Idris is a Nigerian politician and lawmaker in the Nigerian National Assembly. He hails from Yobe State, Nigeria. He has served in the Yobe State National Assembly, representing the Fika/Fune constituency since 2019. He was succeeded by  Mohammed Aliyu Sakin Kasuwa.\n\n\n== References ==",
